Subject: [PATCH 1/3] warp status, rotate, delete, license: an absent identity
 file exits 66 (no-input), not 78

GitHub #731. The check of the saved identity gave Fault::Config for an
absent file. It gives Fault::NoInput now, as the contract of the exit
codes says for a missing identity. A stat error and PODNET_STATE_DIR=none
stay 78. The row 66 of podnet man exit-status names the WARP identity.

Test: exit_contract exit_66_is_a_missing_warp_identity (the four
commands, at the default path and at --identity).
